| 2022 | 21   | 40  | 24   | 12    |
| 2023 | 17   | 38  | 28   | 16    |
| 2024 | 13   | 36  | 31   | 21    |

plot Mix
type: stacked
data: Energy
title: Electricity by source (TWh) by year

sheet Tariff

// A price for each kWh, entered in pence: the unit is in the head, once, and
// a bare number is pence, kept as a hundredth of a pound.
Hour : Time
Rate : Quantity[GBP.kWh^-1; p.0f]

| Hour  | Rate |
| ----- | ---- |
| 00:00 | 12   |
| 01:00 | 11   |
| 02:00 | 11   |
| 03:00 | 10   |
| 04:00 | 10   |
| 05:00 | 11   |
| 06:00 | 15   |
| 07:00 | 22   |
| 08:00 | 28   |
